      },
      "lineNbr": 985,
      "author": {
        "id": 1572468
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-03-25T15:55:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "urgh, yeah, the SMMU architecture has historically done a bad job with things like NoSnoop. Please add a comment here, then, which says that we can\u0027t trust the host not to reconfigure coherent devices to emit non-coherent transactions.",
      "parentUuid": "bb735580_34acdf0f",
